{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225370","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322537001:0":{"text":"큰 물고기가 많이 잡히는 낚시 포인트? 음... 물고기가 크지 않다고 낚시 포인트 탓을 하는 당신들 같은 사람들은 많이 보았지요.","source_cn":"鱼又大又多的钓点？哦……我总能遇上你们这样的，鱼不多不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37A31B5E29A574D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322537002:0":{"text":"하지만 사람들이 많이 가지 않는 곳일수록 물고기가 크지요. 유적의 꽃바다 쪽이 괜찮다고 들었어요. 거기서 잡은 물고기들은 하나같이 엄청 크다고 하더군요!","source_cn":"不过人越少去的地方鱼越大嘛，我听说遗迹花海那边倒是不错...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDDBE85DC405F7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322537003:0":{"text":"조금 멀기는 한데, 거기로 가려면 조심해야 할 거예요.","source_cn":"不过路途遥远，你们要过去的话路上可要注意安全啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4448CE4506CD30BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:钓鱼客":{"text":"낚시꾼","source":"钓鱼客","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}